%N A400518 Number of equivalence classes of n X n binary matrices under cyclic permutations of rows and complementations of columns.
%C A400518 The acting group is C_n X C_2^n, of order n*2^n.
%F A400518 a(n) = (1/(n*2^n))*(Sum_{d|n, d odd} phi(d)*2^(n^2/d) + Sum_{d|n, d even} phi(d)*2^(n^2/d+n)).
%e A400518 For n = 3, the identity fixes 2^9 matrices and each of the two nonidentity cyclic row permutations fixes 2^3 matrices. No operation involving complementation of columns fixes a matrix. Hence a(3) = (2^9 + 2*2^3)/(3*2^3) = 22.
%Y A400518 Cf. A179043 (cyclic permutations of both rows and columns).
%K A400518 nonn,new
%O A400518 1,2
